1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,961
Genesis brings you back to 2045.

2
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:07,850
You're back! Are you okay?

3
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:10,388
I'm fine. Did anything change?

4
00:00:11,183 --> 00:00:15,890
Look. The smoke has cleared in some regions.
There's a little more blue.

5
00:00:26,183 --> 00:00:30,014
The records have changed. What you did back
there is reaching us here.

6
00:00:30,034 --> 00:00:35,714
Genesis has energy for another jump. But you
can only go back if the future keeps improving.

7
00:00:37,050 --> 00:00:39,773
Get ready. There are still places to save.
